## Mandatory research (all five writers)

Before any outline or draft, **every writer must scan the internet**: current markets, line movement, official status, and beat reporting. Do not rely only on stale model allocation or training knowledge when reporting conflicts (e.g. QB competitions, starter battles). Follow `research-standards.md` in full — web research is required, not optional.

## Execution

